+      - .garura/project/issues/653/specs/plan.md       # modified: item 2 turned into "Built", now moved 2 to 3, three "Also:" lines added to items 3, 8 and 10, two log lines added
+      - .garura/project/issues/654/specs/stories.yaml  # modified: five comment lines appended recording that the Done-when lists of #656, #661 and #663 gained ADR 035's uncovered files; no structural change to the stories
+    notes: >
+      Same category as in the #665 review (654) and the #652 review (613): Garura's own STM
+      working notes. No playbook covers it. Suggested Layer 1 only: plan front-matter sanity
+      (plan_for, kind, status, serves_plan, serves_item, now) with 655/context/plan-check.json
+      as the receipt; the 653 plan's "Built" entry for item 2 agrees with what the diff
